": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "加息美元一定会升值，但美元升值不一定是加息引起的", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "8671-8705", "createTime": 1773496412, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "297649821_87BoJiDEC", "userVid": 297649821, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 297649821, "name": "前行者", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0021-GIXEK~0RZ9oNf24EEqkqp10/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "有无相生", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "以物观物，性也；以我观物，情也", "medalInfo": {"id": "M12-0-0-E-0-0-0", "desc": "世界读书日", "title": "世界读书日", "levelIndex": 0}}}, "likesCount": 6, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "426066534_8benkJ0qB", "review": {"abstract": "真实利率持续多年高于其他国家，是美元进入升值周期的充分但非必要条件。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "\n加息周期中美元可能下跌（1994-1995），降息周期中美元也可能上涨（1995-2001的低利率后期）。真正驱动美元长期走势的，是美国经济相对于欧元区、日本等主要经济体的增长动能强弱，以及市场如何“定价”美联储的每一次动作", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "\n加息周期中美元可能下跌（1994-1995），降息周期中美元也可能上涨（1995-2001的低利率后期）。真正驱动美元长期走势的，是美国经济相对于欧元区、日本等主要经济体的增长动能强弱，以及市场如何“定价”美联储的每一次动作", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8671-8705", "createTime": 1786275186, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_8benkJ0qB", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1786275342, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 1}]}, {"range": "8766-8841", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 3, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "254854030_880ThLaiC", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "1. 当政府把真实利率大幅提高到GDP增速之上，意味着无风险收益超过了整个经济的实际增长能力，资金会疯狂从实体、股市、楼市撤出，转向债券和现金。一方面能快速压制通胀、吸引全球资本流入、推高美元，但会导致企业融资成本过高、投资萎缩、经济降温甚至衰退，国内资产价格普遍下跌，只是美元强势、金融账面好看。\n2. 当政府把真实利率压低到GDP增速之下，资金成本极低，钱会大量流向实体投资、股市、房地产，刺激经济增长、提升企业盈利、推动资产价格上涨，有利于内需和就业，但会引发通胀上升、美元走弱、资本外流，长期过度压低还会造成资产泡沫、货币贬值压力增大。", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "abstract": "在正常条件下，真实利率应该围绕GDP增速波动（见图10-7）​。但政府为了达到调控目的，可以人为地把真实利率大幅提高到GDP增速之上，或者压低到其之下。", "range": "8766-8841", "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "254854030_880ThLaiC", "userVid": 254854030, "topics": [], "createTime": 1774944412, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 254854030, "name": "薄荷白桃乌龙茶", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/DYAIOgq83eotCrwSFSicibG99Nkf5vrg0ff5gIBNXvxUEHLjQOgqCkgge06Nib9Vp2791QZZJPKUpm1JVpXRn1RoA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20240826-10", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "完美阅读周", "levelIndex": 10}}}, "likesCount": 14}, {"reviewId": "324446735_87Na2picP", "review": {"abstract": "在正常条件下，真实利率应该围绕GDP增速波动（见图10-7）。但政府为了达到调控目的，可以人为地把真实利率大幅提高到GDP增速之上，或者压低到其之下。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "利率是资金的价格，经济增长代表了资金所能获得的平均回报。如果真实利率长期大幅高于经济增速，意味着借钱成本太高，会抑制企业投资和经济发展。\n反之，如果真实利率长期明显低于经济增速，意味着资金成本过低，容易引发过度投资、产能过剩和资产泡沫。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "8766-8841", "createTime": 1774164556, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "324446735_87Na2picP", "userVid": 324446735, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 324446735, "name": "Ashley", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0007-i4S31ny77rgrobLawo7rdf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "Ashley", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "读书 是为了看见一个真实的世界", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-500", "desc": "想法发布", "title": "想法发布", "levelIndex": 500}}}, "likesCount": 2}, {"reviewId": "426066534_8dcQVFw6L", "review": {"abstract": "在正常条件下，真实利率应该围绕GDP增速波动（见图10-7）。但政府为了达到调控目的，可以人为地把真实利率大幅提高到GDP增速之上，或者压低到其之下。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "一般情况下，经济潜在增长率约等于长期资金平均回报率，利率是资金成本，如果资金成本调高，就只有利润率本身很高的行业能存活下去，这样就抑制了企业投资生产和消费，反之则激发经济活力", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "一般情况下，经济潜在增长率约等于长期资金平均回报率，利率是资金成本，如果资金成本调高，就只有利润率本身很高的行业能存活下去，这样就抑制了企业投资生产和消费，反之则激发经济活力", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "8766-8841", "createTime": 1793231928, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_8dcQVFw6L", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "userEditTime": 1793232115, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}}]}, {"range": "8900-8952", "bookMarkCount": 0, "maxIdx": 0, "totalCount": 3, "hasMore": 0, "synckey": 1793261222, "pageReviews": [{"reviewId": "253680463_88FY8pclN", "review": {"abstract": "但当压低真实利率时，即使真实利率低于其他国家，也不表明美国其他投资方式的平均风险折减收益率低于其他国家。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "人为抬高利率，主要是通过直接提升“无风险资产”的回报来增加美元吸引力。\n人为压低利率，则是通过降低系统性风险、并大幅提升“风险资产”（如股市）的预期回报，从而维持甚至提高了美国作为一个整体的“平均风险折减收益率”，以此来支撑美元。这就像是为美元提供了另一种不同于高利率的吸引力。", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 0, "range": "8900-8952", "createTime": 1777277664, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "253680463_88FY8pclN", "userVid": 253680463, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 253680463, "name": "那の小娜", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/Q0j4TwGTfTJJI1JrTyvrQL5ibJL2bgKia3zSm7g2qUnKzfiavnXVRSvRF5z6m9Mgicbyp81qe009GUWkhibTfA5gfuA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M2-0-1000", "desc": "阅读时长", "title": "阅读时长", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "likesCount": 3}, {"reviewId": "426066534_89sUYzNpP", "review": {"abstract": "但当压低真实利率时，即使真实利率低于其他国家，也不表明美国其他投资方式的平均风险折减收益率低于其他国家。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterUid": 15, "content": "人为拉高利率，可以使美元升值，人为压低利率，不一定美元贬值", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "range": "8900-8952", "createTime": 1780057981, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "426066534_89sUYzNpP", "userVid": 426066534, "topics": [], "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 426066534, "name": "阳.", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0001-o8W1y4kRnfhpyNG0a2oPXe1/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "vDesc": "纯与真，丙丁炼庚金", "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "愿祖国繁荣昌盛，国泰民安。", "medalInfo": {"id": "M14-0-100", "desc": "拯救书荒", "title": "好书导读人", "levelIndex": 100}}}, "likesCount": 3, "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": []}, {"reviewId": "47499302_87HxadBKH", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "简言之，第一美联储加息美元必定走强，第二就算利率不一定比别的国家高，经济增长强劲美元一样走强", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "8900-8952", "abstract": "但当压低真实利率时，即使真实利率低于其他国家，也不表明美国其他投资方式的平均风险折减收益率低于其他国家。", "type": 1, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "chapterUid": 15, "chapterName": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "chapterIdx": 15, "reviewId": "47499302_87HxadBKH", "userVid": 47499302, "topics": [], "createTime": 1773844941, "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "10 美元破百的全球影响", "author": {"userVid": 47499302, "name": "L", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/Ib5852jAybicP6njMScZJ2qzmliazzYtSZsKFGeo7ibq5zR1P8ic9EmwSVcicMOma7lVZTXIsMV6mmDA/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M7-0-10", "desc